{"version":1,"content":"<p>周二，「矽谷與世界」大會上，CoreWeave行政總裁米高·因特拉託（Michael Intrator）暗示，他並不特別擔心黃仁勳離職會對CoreWeave的業務造成影響。因特拉託表示，英偉達是一家「非凡的公司」，該公司還擁有「成千上萬名優秀的工程師和員工」，雙方的合作關係將繼續維持。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586942.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T10:04:00.012067+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":148,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T09:43:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T09:57:14.251639+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T09:57:14.251639+00:00","content_hash":"552de17fe269618f9ed3e90ae5910e1ef88427b41da73afb66ced2f09e527f6c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}